      "prompt": "The ratio of blue to red marbles is 2 to 7. If 19 blue marbles are added, the ratio becomes 41 to 77. How many red marbles are there?",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "options": [
        "77",
        "41",
        "58",
        "96",
        "22"
